<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
    <meta name="description" content="Prepare for domestic and international pet travel with route planning, paperwork support, crate guidance, and journey coordination.">
    <title>Pet Transport Services | <%= business.name %></title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/img/favicon.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/slicknav.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/custom.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/service-detail.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    
    
<link href="/css/brand.css" rel="stylesheet">
<%- include('../partials/chat') %>
<link href="/css/zoom.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/site-header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="page-header-box">
                <h2>Pet Transport</h2>
                <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol class="breadcrumb">
                        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="service.html">Services</a></li>
                        <li>Pet Transport</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="service-detail-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row service-detail-layout">
                <aside class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="service-sidebar">
                        <div class="service-nav-card">
                            <h3>Our Services</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li><a href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                                <li><a class="active" href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-help-card">
                            <h3>Getting ready to move your pet?</h3>
                            <p>Share your pet’s details, travel route, preferred date, and any health or handling considerations.</p>
                            <a href="contact.html">Review Your Pet’s Journey <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </aside>

                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="service-main-image pet-service-image">
                        <img src="/images/post-22.jpeg" alt="Dogs, cats, birds, and other pets prepared for safe transport">
                    </div>

                    <section class="service-overview">
                        <div class="service-kicker">Support throughout the journey</div>
                        <h1>Thoughtful planning for your pet’s journey</h1>
                        <p>Pet travel takes preparation, suitable transport arrangements, and attention to individual needs. <%= business.name %> helps owners coordinate domestic and international journeys from collection to arrival.</p>
                        <p>Before travel, we review the route, dates, pet details, crate needs, paperwork, and destination requirements. We coordinate the journey and keep owners informed, while veterinarians, carriers, and authorities handle their respective approvals.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="service-features">
                        <h2 class="service-section-title">Support for your pet’s move</h2>
                        <div class="row g-4">
                            <div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-route"></i><h3>Route and schedule planning</h3><p>Travel stages planned around your pet, route, schedule, and destination requirements.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-notes-medical"></i><h3>Travel paperwork support</h3><p>Help identifying paperwork to confirm with your veterinarian and the relevant authorities.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-box"></i><h3>Preparing the travel crate</h3><p>Support with preparing a secure travel crate of a suitable size for your pet and journey.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-comment-dots"></i><h3>Travel updates</h3><p>Updates at key travel stages to help owners follow the journey.</p></div></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="service-process">
                        <h2 class="service-section-title">Planning your pet’s move</h2>
                        <div class="row g-4">
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Review</h3><p>We gather your pet’s details, route, timing, and health considerations.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>We review travel paperwork, crate needs, and journey requirements.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Coordinate</h3><p>We connect collection, carrier transfers, and arrival arrangements.</p></div></div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Reunite</h3><p>We coordinate the final handoff with the receiving contact.</p></div></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="service-faqs">
                        <h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about pet travel</h2>
                        <div class="accordion" id="petFaq">
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#petOne">What details do you need to plan pet travel?</button></h3>
                                <div id="petOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#petFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Tell us the species, breed, age, size, weight, health considerations, origin, destination, preferred date, and whether the journey is domestic or international.</div></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#petTwo">What health paperwork might my pet need?</button></h3>
                                <div id="petTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#petFaq"><div class="accordion-body">The destination may require veterinary examinations, vaccination records, health certificates, permits, microchip details, or other official paperwork. Confirm the final requirements with a licensed veterinarian and the destination authorities.</div></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#petThree">How can I prepare my pet for the journey?</button></h3>
                                <div id="petThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#petFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Preparation may involve getting your pet used to the crate, arranging veterinary checks, updating identification, and planning food and water according to carrier instructions. Discuss any medical or sedation decisions with your veterinarian.</div></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <div class="service-cta">
                        <div><h2>Start planning your pet’s journey</h2><p>Get in touch early to allow time for route planning, paperwork, and travel preparation.</p></div>
                        <a href="/quote?service=domestic_air" class="btn-default">Discuss Pet Travel</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>
    
    <script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
